<title>SRI LANKA: Vanik 3-month net slumps.</title>
<headline>Vanik 3-month net slumps.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unauditd results of Vanik Incorporation Ltd for the three months ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>				 1997		 1996</p>
<p>    Turnover		214.31    vs     218.38</p>
<p>    Net profit		0.15    vs	 5.40</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.11    vs	 0.44</p>
<p>NOTE - Vanik Incorporation Ltd, is an investment bank which consolidates results with Vanik Money Brokers, Vanik Corporate Services and LB Finance.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
